### 1) Seed CRM data
POST http://localhost:8096/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Inspect discovered schema (what the planner sees)
GET http://localhost:8096/api/crm/schema

### 3) Query: OPEN deals for Acme
POST http://localhost:8096/api/crm/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Show open deals for account Acme",
  "entityTypes": ["deal", "account"]
}

### 4) Query: HIGH priority OPEN tickets for Globex
POST http://localhost:8096/api/crm/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "List high priority open tickets for account Globex",
  "entityTypes": ["support-ticket", "account"]
}

### 5) Query: Contacts for Initech
POST http://localhost:8096/api/crm/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "List contacts for account Initech",
  "entityTypes": ["contact", "account"]
}

### 6) Query: Accounts in EMEA with revenue over 1000000
POST http://localhost:8096/api/crm/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Show accounts in EMEA with annual revenue over 1000000",
  "entityTypes": ["account"]
}
